{"4469130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "I KNOW YOUR ADDRESS 2", "steam_appid": 4469130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A collection of 5 comedy games: Run a haunted house, &quot;debate&quot; in turn-based trivia-battles, escape a terrifying math-obsessed mascot, choose your path in a live-action boredom simulator, and guide 1 to 4 while avoiding 2 and 3.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469130/extras/3cf17dea1a9182267aaf0301bc7a82dd.avif?t=1775060989\" width=220 height=68 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In 1234, you play as <strong>1</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You must avoid <strong>2</strong> and <strong>3</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You must get to <strong>4</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Beyond this, anything is allowed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469130/extras/1edfacb67e5478cf8219e2d96ce36634.poster.avif?t=1775060989\" width=640 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469130/extras/1edfacb67e5478cf8219e2d96ce36634.webm?t=1775060989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469130/extras/1edfacb67e5478cf8219e2d96ce36634.mp4?t=1775060989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ETERNAL HALLOWEEN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Slay ghouls and use their souls to upgrade a haunted house and scare trick-or-treaters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469130/extras/3e2b6aa85f2d53d3f0e43d042990dcdd.poster.avif?t=1775060989\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469130/extras/3e2b6aa85f2d53d3f0e43d042990dcdd.webm?t=1775060989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469130/extras/3e2b6aa85f2d53d3f0e43d042990dcdd.mp4?t=1775060989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SMART BATTLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Run errands while debating anyone who doubts your superior intellect in traditional RPG battles where you attack by  solving trivia questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469130/extras/a96f413c8b76188df4bd7bc5330350f5.poster.avif?t=1775060989\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469130/extras/a96f413c8b76188df4bd7bc5330350f5.webm?t=1775060989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469130/extras/a96f413c8b76188df4bd7bc5330350f5.mp4?t=1775060989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>EXTREME FRACTIONS 2</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore an abandoned school while hiding from its math-obsessed mascot. Math minigames may block the way, solve them with haste lest the Math Witch catch up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469130/extras/f1662d09904f2da85c21f2f2c9d95241.poster.avif?t=1775060989\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469130/extras/f1662d09904f2da85c21f2f2c9d95241.webm?t=1775060989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469130/extras/f1662d09904f2da85c21f2f2c9d95241.mp4?t=1775060989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DECISION PARALYSIS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Cure your boredom at any cost in this live-action choose-your-own-adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469130/extras/2d5fd72178764a70a635f726029ecf44.poster.avif?t=1775060989\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469130/extras/2d5fd72178764a70a635f726029ecf44.webm?t=1775060989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469130/extras/2d5fd72178764a70a635f726029ecf44.mp4?t=1775060989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A collection of 5 comedy games: Run a haunt